### 测试服务是否正常
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search/test

### 批量同步到 ES
POST http://localhost:8080/api/search/sync-all

### 搜索建议/自动补全
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search/suggest?prefix=深度

### 搜索文献 - 深度学习
POST http://localhost:8080/api/literature/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "深度学习",
  "page": 1,
  "size": 10
}

### 搜索文献 - SpringBoot
POST http://localhost:8080/api/literature/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "SpringBoot",
  "page": 1,
  "size": 10
}

### 搜索文献 - 区块链
POST http://localhost:8080/api/literature/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "区块链",
  "page": 1,
  "size": 10
}

### 搜索文献 - 带分页
POST http://localhost:8080/api/literature/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "技术",
  "page": 1,
  "size": 5
}

### 获取文献详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/literature/1

### 直接测试 ES - 深度学习
GET http://localhost:9200/literature/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "multi_match": {
      "query": "深度学习",
      "fields": ["title^3", "abstractText", "keywords", "authors"]
    }
  }
}

### 直接测试 ES - 查看所有数据
GET http://localhost:9200/literature/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match_all": {}
  }
}

### 直接测试 ES - 测试建议补全
GET http://localhost:9200/literature/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "suggest": {
    "title_suggest": {
      "prefix": "深度",
      "completion": {
        "field": "suggest",
        "size": 10,
        "skip_duplicates": true
      }
    }
  }
}

### 查看 ES 索引映射
GET http://localhost:9200/literature/_mapping

### 查看 ES 索引设置
GET http://localhost:9200/literature/_settings

### 删除 ES 索引（慎用）
DELETE http://localhost:9200/literature


### 从 ES 中删除单条文献
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/search/es/1

### 从 ES 中批量删除文献
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/search/es/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 3]

### 同时删除 MySQL 和 ES 中的文献
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/literature/1

### 批量删除 MySQL 和 ES 中的文献
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/literature/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 3]


### 创建 ES 索引（需要配合 mapping）
PUT http://localhost:9200/literature
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "title": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "ik_max_word",
        "search_analyzer": "ik_smart"
      },
      "suggest": {
        "type": "completion"
      }
    }
  }
}